    "text": "Reuters reports ByteDance, Alibaba and Tencent ordered over 3 million NVIDIA RTX PRO 5500 GPUs, worth more than $35B at list prices. These are 84GB workstation cards, not NVIDIA’s top data-center chips. Crucially, orders aren't shipments: the report says NVIDIA cannot guarantee supply. For AI infrastructure, availability may matter as much as raw performance.",
